def "nsdef:exec" "exec — a dispatched workflow run: exec:<bench>:<n> is an immutable membrane over a run of workflow entries (exec:covers), recorded as ONE world-axis sync chronon; a corrected dispatch mints a NEW exec, never edits an old one."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:exec"
def "nsdef:geo" "geo — geography: places, borders, countries, languages."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:geo"
def "nsdef:kind" "kind — the telemetry taxonomy; kind:<domain>:<type> (kind:seismic:quake, kind:orbit:satellite) classifies what a subject/observation is."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:kind"
def "nsdef:labo" "labo — a bounded research namespace observed through four canonical projections (Source, Concept, Society, Notebook); labo:<name> names one. A Society observes/operates/governs it, never owns it."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:labo"
def "nsdef:lex" "lex — lexical / interlingual relations over proto-words (祖語); lex:bridge links a foreign proto-word to its English proto-word so a non-English atom reuses the English graph."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:lex"
def "nsdef:llm" "llm — the shared LLM resource allocation namespace (B10): llm:pool:<provider>:<day> is the visible per-provider per-day aggregate atom (capacity / reserved / spent / refused / by[program]) — COUNTS only, never keys or prompts — joined to the telemetry day Set so retention compacts it; llm:credit:<program> is a refused programme's carry-over credit. A programme reserves its per-run calls at admission and runs prepaid; the one gate (llm_provider.generate) debits the reservation and enforces the hard daily/monthly floor."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:llm"
def "nsdef:model" "model — an immutable machine-vision model identity (model:<family>:<variant>:<version>) carrying full provenance (weights, framework+version, thresholds, input resolution, preprocess). A new config is a new model atom, never an overwrite."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:model"
def "nsdef:nar" "nar — narrative craft (structure, character, conflict, device)."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:nar"
def "nsdef:nsdef" "nsdef — namespace-definition atoms; nsdef:<ns> holds a namespace's description."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:nsdef"
def "nsdef:polti" "polti — Polti's dramatic situations."
set.add name="namespaces" id="nsdef:polti"
